 ╭ Keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │                                                                            │
 │ F5 Ctrl+E   Run the query            Space       Command menu              │
 │ Ctrl+C      Copy row / cancel query  ? F2        Show keys                 │
 │ Ctrl+A      Copy all rows            Esc         Back / close              │
 │ Tab         Next panel               q Ctrl+Q    Quit                      │
 │ Shift+Tab   Previous panel           Enter       Select / new line         │
 │ /           Filter                   ↑           Up                        │
 │ R           Refresh                  ↓           Down                      │
 │ n           New connection           ←           Left / previous column    │
 │ e           Edit connection          →           Right / next column       │
 │ Delete d    Delete connection        PgUp        Page up                   │
 │ Ctrl+S      Save                     PgDn        Page down                 │
 │ F1          Connection list          Home        First row / line start    │
 │ Ctrl+T      Next theme               End         Last row / line end       │
 │ F12         Event log                Backspace   Delete a character        │
 │                                                                            │
 ╰───────────────────────────── any key to close ─────────────────────────────╯
